00:21.200 --> 00:23.801
Every week. On top of building it.

00:28.800 --> 00:33.778
That’s where good apps stall: a founder on their own, with no team and no plan.

00:34.400 --> 00:36.740
Traction gives your app a growth team.

00:37.300 --> 00:40.319
An AI Growth Manager runs it. You lead.

00:41.000 --> 00:43.340
It reads your app like a new customer.

00:43.800 --> 00:47.472
It finds people your app could help, and writes to each in your voice.

00:48.000 --> 00:51.959
Ask in a sentence, and it comes back with a plan to your date.

00:52.400 --> 00:55.994
It keeps up with your market, and matches your numbers to the work.

00:56.500 --> 00:59.023
Nothing goes out without your yes.

00:59.400 --> 01:01.923
Then embed your app on Orchestra OS.

01:02.200 --> 01:08.119
We build, host, secure and support it with you, and scale it with the demand Traction brings.

01:09.000 --> 01:11.183
Grow your app with a team behind you.

01:11.600 --> 01:13.470
Start with your app’s address.
